  m_text: "PRODUCTION\r\nEmily Tran\r\nSamantha \u201CSammy\u201D Chang\nEthan Yoshino\r\nDamon
    Phan\r\n\nART DEPARTMENT\r\nSavannah \"Savvy\" Burch\nMike \u201CVitic\u201D
    McInnes\nAlexa Medina\r\nIvy Dudzik\r\n\nWRITING DEPARTMENT\r\nJoe Gibson\r\nAmanda
    \"Mandy\" Stafford\r\nParker Ehlers\r\n\nPROGRAMMING DEPARTMENT\r\nDylan \u201CEchoLane\u201D
    Mahler\nGarrett Blake\r\nJonah Ryan\r\n\nDESIGN DEPARTMENT\r\nEvan Lake\r\n\nSOUND
    DEPARTMENT\r\nSamuel Spivey\r\nAutumn Moulios\r\nMichael Nieto\r\n\r"
